}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 On the day appointed, the clergy and people gather with the bishop in a\par
}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 place apart from the church or chapel.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 When all are ready, the Bishop says the following or similar words}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Through the ages, Almighty God has moved his people to\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 build houses of prayer and praise, and to set apart places for\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 the ministry of his holy Word and Sacraments.  With gratitude\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 for the building (rebuilding, }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 or}{\plain \fs24 \f3  adornment) of (}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 name of church}{\plain \fs24 \f3 ), \softline
we are now gathered to dedicate and consecrate\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 it in God's Name. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Let us pray.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Almighty God, we thank you for making us in your image, to\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 share in the ordering of your world.  Receive the work of our\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 hands in this place, now to be set apart for your worship, the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 building up of the living, and the remembrance of the dead,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to the praise and glory of your Name; through Jesus Christ\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 our Lord.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Necessary announcements may now be made.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 As the procession approaches the door of the church, singing and\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 instrumental music are appropriate.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\column 
