{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Standing at the door of the church, the Bishop says}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Let the door(s) be opened. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The door is opened.  With the pastoral staff the Bishop marks the\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 threshold with the sign of the cross saying}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Peace be to this house, and to all who enter here:  {\f4 \'61}   In the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 As the procession moves into the church, Psalm 122 or some other\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 appropriate psalm is sung. Hymns and anthems may also be sung. \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The congregation standing, the Bishop begins the Prayer for the\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Consecration of the Church\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \tab \tab Our help is in the Name of the Lord; \par
}\pard \fs24\fi-1062\li1062\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 People}{\plain \fs24 \f3   \ul0 \tab The maker of heaven and earth. \par
}\pard \fs24\fi-1062\li1062\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Bishop}{\plain \fs24 \f3   \ul0 \tab Let us pray. \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Everliving Father, watchful and caring, our source and our end: \softline
All that we are and all that we have is yours. Accept us now, as \softline
we dedicate this place to which we come to praise your Name, to \softline
ask your forgiveness, to know your healing power, to hear your \softline
Word, and to be nourished by the Body and Blood of your Son. \softline
Be present always to guide and to judge, to illumine and to bless \softline
your people. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 A Warden or other representative of the congregation continues}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Lord Jesus Christ, make this a temple of your presence and a \softline
house of prayer. Be always near us when we seek you in this \softline
