{\plain \fs36 \i\f3\fs36 Additional Directions}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 The complete form of the service for the Dedication and Consecration of\par
}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 a Church is to be used at the opening of a church or chapel. This service \softline
does not require that the premises be debt-free or owned.\par
}\pard \fs20\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20  \par
}\pard \fs20\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 When the clergy and people assemble before the service, they may gather out \softline
of doors, in the parish house, in a former or neighboring place of worship, \softline
or in some other building.  When convenient, the procession may go around \softline
the building(s) to be dedicated and then go to the principal door.  Hymns or \softline
psalms may be used in procession. The use of portable musical instruments \softline
is suitable. If there is an organ, it is appropriate that it remain silent until \softline
dedicated. When the weather is inclement, or other circumstances make it  \softline
necessary, the congregation may assemble inside the church; but the bishop, \softline
other clergy, and attendants will enter in procession through the principal \softline
door.\par
}\pard \fs20\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 \par
}\pard \fs20\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 When a new church is being consecrated, it is desirable that sacred vessels, \softline
ornaments, and decorations be carried into the building in the procession. \softline
Such things as the deed for the property and the blueprint of the building(s), \softline
the keys, and tools used in its construction may also be carried by \softline
appropriate persons.\par
}\pard \fs20\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20  \par
}\pard \fs20\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
