form (incised, painted, inlaid).  In place of a pastoral staff, the foot of a \softline
processional cross may be used for the signing.\par
}\pard \fs20\sl120\slmult1\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20  \par
}\pard \fs20\tx-955\tx-720\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 At the dedication of the font, children or other lay persons are to be \softline
